* Op-Amp Circuit

V1 1 0 DC <Vs_value> ; Voltage source Vs with positive at node 1, grounded
Rs 1 2 <Rs_value> ; Resistor Rs between nodes 1 and 2

* Ideal op-amp model
* Connecting op-amp inputs and outputs
Vin_p 2 0 DC 0 ; Non-inverting input at node 2
Vin_n 3 0 DC 0 ; Inverting input not used
Vout 4 0 ; Output at node 4

Rl 4 0 <Rl_value> ; Load resistor RL between node 4 and ground

.end